---
description: Python implementation boundaries for Altdown Tools
globs: src/**/*.py,tests/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

Read `AGENTS.md` and the active feature plan before coding.
Use one shared transport/parser core; do not duplicate it between `fetch` and `check`.
All outbound requests must use the bounded injectable transport.
No real-network unit tests, credentials, proxies or implicit environment state.
Do not implement deferred `crawl`/`diff` features in v0.1.
